	// AddReaction React to a message
	//
	// Adds the caller's reaction to a message: one emoji from a fixed set, named in the
	// path (`thumbsup` 👍, `check` ✅, `eyes` 👀, `heart` ❤️, `tada` 🎉, `question` ❓).
